{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】北京市副市長夏林茂涉嚴重違紀違法受查。</p><p>新華社報道，北京市委常委、副市長夏林茂涉嚴重違紀違法，正接受中央紀委國家監委紀律審查與監察調查。</p><p>56歲的夏林茂長期在北京規劃建設系統任職，三年前升任北京市副市長，並身兼中共中央候補委員。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T09:42:33.870747+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T09:17:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T11:17:52.391971+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T09:37:51.520436+00:00","content_hash":"afb14b5864d3c3e4da4b965d6234358a89cc0cabb07ed3a2895a84c47d177214","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}